name: procurement_debarred_directors
description: "Debarred firms' directors - every directorship of every person who directed a debarred company (via = from and to dates and the debarment day) and the tenders their companies won (procurement_debarment_links_dataset). A cleaning firm debarred in January 2026: its two directors resign days later and run a new firm incorporated in February that wins a cleaning tender in April. Most debarred firms' directors never reappear; one, from a firm debarred in 2022, joins a long-established transport firm three and a half years later."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: procurement_debarment_links_dataset
    sourceCol: src
    targetCol: dst
    linkKindCol: kind
    attrCols[4]: ts,amount,via,market
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    hulls: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
